   "title": "How this works",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## 2 \u00b7 The world\nHiDream-O1 paints the film's world as an **empty location plate**: nobody is in it.\n\nIt goes in as **Picture 1** of every shot, so the only face any shot ever sees is the lead's (Picture 2). The studio checks the plate is empty with **12 \u00b7 people check** and re-rolls if not."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
